      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "HOW TO PLAY\n\nOBJECTIVE\nFind the object displayed on your HUD before
    the countdown hits zero. Each correct find awards points and moves you to the
    next round.\n\nGAZE CONTROLS\n\u2022 Interact: Hold your reticle over an object,
    power-up, or menu button until the fill meter completes.\n\u2022 Close Panel:
    Simply look away from this board to return to the Main Menu.\n\nDIFFICULTY MODES\nChoose
    your challenge on the main menu:\n\u2022 Easy: 12 seconds per target (minimum
    7s)\n\u2022 Medium: 10 seconds per target (minimum 5s)\n\u2022 Hard: 7 seconds
    per target (minimum 3s)\n\u2022 Extreme: Fixed 5-second blitz for every round\nNote:
    Time per target scales down as your score increases.\n\nPOWER-UPS\n\u2022 Keep
    an eye out for floating power-up items scattered across the rooms.\n\u2022 Focus
    your gaze on a power-up to collect it and gain extra time on your clock!\n\nROOMS
    & PROGRESSION\n\u2022 Select your starting room from the main menu options.\n\u2022
    Accumulate points to trigger room transitions and search through new environments
    in Extreme Mode."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a8580af8576b04ff795f84ea492ad969, type: 2}
